# PlantMetWiki context for slide 25: the metabolite glucotropaeolin and the pathways it is part of.
#
# Real PlantMetWiki RDF, not retyped: result of a CONSTRUCT on https://plantmetwiki.bioinformatics.nl/sparql
# on 2026-11-10 (raw response in raw_pmw.ttl; query in notes/log/2026-11-10-rdf-visualizer.md).
# Only the triples needed for the slide are kept (type, label, identifiers, isPartOf pathway); interactions and
# descriptions are left out.
#
# Note: the slide (pilot data) names the pathways PWY-6684 and PWY-2821, which agrees with this.
# The PC numbers (PC848, PC1071) are the ones of the endpoint on 2026-11-10; they differ from the
# 2026-10-01 snapshot used by the pilots (see the session log).

